{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56624","headline":"唐凤皇镜铭 · 无名氏","name":"唐凤皇镜铭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"对凤皇舞，铸黄金蔕。\n（《金石索》首句作「凤凰双镜南金装」。\n）阴阳各有合（《金石索》作「爲配」），日月恒相会。\n白玉芙蓉匣，翠羽琼瑶带。\n同心人，心（《金石索》无「心」字）相亲，照心照胆保千春。\n（见《西溪丛语》。\n《金石索·金索六》有凤凰双镜铭，文字稍异。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56624.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56624","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}